This is a placeholder for the user flow diagram image.
The image needs to be manually generated from the mermaid markdown in user-flow-diagram.md
and saved as user-flow-diagram.png in this directory.

You can generate this image using:
1. Paste the mermaid diagram code from user-flow-diagram.md into https://mermaid.live/
2. Export as PNG
3. Save the PNG as user-flow-diagram.png in the docs/assets/ directory

This is needed to ensure diagrams render properly on GitHub mobile. 